OL,3,AChancellor to say UK economy 'turning a
OL,4,Acorner' despite debt concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor is set to give an upbeat
OL,7,Fview of the state of the UK economy
OL,8,Fahead of next month's Budget, building
OL,9,Fon a recent uptick in consumer and
OL,10,Fbusiness confidence.
OL,12,FIn a speech on Monday in Coventry, John
OL,13,FHealey will talk of a "new story" of
OL,14,Fthe economy not just turning a corner
OL,15,Fbut being resilient, optimistic and
OL,16,F"ready to seize the opportunities of
OL,17,Fnew technologies and ideas".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
