OL,3,AChancellor to say UK economy 'turning a
OL,4,Acorner' despite debt concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut nearby, Jaguar Land Rover is
OL,7,Fplanning to cut thousands of jobs to
OL,8,Fsave costs following competition from
OL,9,FChina for cheap cars, US tariffs on UK
OL,10,Fvehicles and the after effects of a
OL,11,Fcyber attack.
OL,13,FHealey is also facing concerns about
OL,14,Fgovernment borrowing costs and the
OL,15,Finflationary impact of the Iran war.
